" \\\n"
"each field to a field named tag::<field>. If you specify 'outputfield', "
"\\\n"
"'inclname' and 'inclvalue' control whether the field name and field "
"values \\\n"
"are added to the output field.  By default only the tag itself is written"
" to \\\n"
"the outputfield. E.g.: (<field>::)?(<value>::)?tag \\\n"
"If 'allowed_tags' is specified, the command returns only the tags in the "
"\\\n"
"'allowed_tags' argument. You can specify multiple tags in the "
"'allowed_tags' \\\n"
"argument as a comma-separated, double-quoted string."
msgstr ""
"用标记注释搜索结果。如果有指定\\\n"
"字段，该命令则只会为这些字段注释标记。否则，它会为\\\n"
"所有字段寻找标记。如果指定了 'outputfield'，该命令会为此字段\\\n"
"的所有字段写入标记。否则，它会为\\\n"
"名为 tag::<field> 的字段的每个字段写入标记。如果指定了 'outputfield'，\\\n"
"则 'inclname' 和 'inclvalue' 会控制字段名和字段值\\\n"
"是否要添加到输出字段。默认情况下，只有标记本身会写入到\\\n"
"输出字段。例如: (<field>::)?(<value>::)?tag \\\n"
"如果指定了 'allowed_tags'，该命令则会只返回\\\n"
"'allowed_tags' 参数中的标记。您可以在 'allowed_tags' 参数中指定多个标记，\\\n"
"作为以逗号分隔、带双引号的字符串。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3618 
msgid "Anonymize data matching pattern"
msgstr "匿名数据匹配模式"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6320 
msgid "Anonymize the current search results."
msgstr "使当前搜索结果匿名。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6319 
msgid ""
"Anonymizes the search results by replacing identifying data - usernames, "
"IP addresses, domain names, etc. - with fictional values that maintain "
"the same word length. For example, it may turn the string "
"user=carol@adalberto.com into user=aname@mycompany.com. This lets Splunk "
"users share log data without revealing confidential or personal "
"information. By default the dictionary and configuration files found in "
"$SPLUNK_HOME/etc/anonymizer are used.  These can be overridden by "
"specifying arguments to the scrub command.  The arguments exactly "
"correspond to the settings in the stand-alone \"splunk anonymize\" "
"command, and are documented there.  Anonymizes all attributes, exception "
"those that start with \"_\" (except \"_raw\") or \"date_\", or the "
"following attributes: \"eventtype\", \"linecount\", \"punct\", "
"\"sourcetype\", \"timeendpos\", \"timestartpos\". \\\n"
"When using alternative filenames, they must not contain paths and refer "
"to files located in $SPLUNK_HOME/etc/anonymizer, or the optional "
"namespace=\"appname\" must be used to specify an app supplying the files,"
" and they will be read from $SPLUNK_HOME/etc/app/<appname>/anonymizer."
msgstr ""
"通过使用保持相同单词长度的虚构值替换标识数据，即用户名、IP 地址、域名等，使搜索结果匿名。 例如，它可以将字符串 user=carol@adalberto.com 变为 user=aname@mycompany.com。这允许 Splunk 用户在不显示机密或私人信息的情况下共享日志数据。 默认情况下，使用 $SPLUNK_HOME/etc/anonymizer 中的字典和配置文件。  通过指定 scrub 命令的参数可对其进行覆盖。  参数与独立的 \"splunk anonymize\" 命令中的设置完全对应，其中有相关说明。  使所有属性匿名，以 \"_\" (\"_raw\" 除外) 或 \"date_\" 开头的属性或者以下属性除外: \"eventtype\"、\"linecount\"、\"punct\"、"
"\"sourcetype\"、\"timeendpos\"、\"timestartpos\"。\\\n"
"当使用替代文件名时，它们必须不包含路径和位于 $SPLUNK_HOME/etc/anonymizer 的参考文件，或可选的 namespace=\"appname\" 必须用于指定一个应用提供文件，并且它们将从 $SPLUNK_HOME/etc/app/<appname>/anonymizer 中读取。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6317 
msgid "Anonymizes the search results."
msgstr "使搜索结果匿名。"

