#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3663 
msgid ""
"Any value sql select arguments, per the syntax found at\\\n"
"http://www.sqlite.org/lang_select.html.  If no \"from results\" is\\\n"
"specified in the select-arg it will be inserted it automatically.\\\n"
"Runs a SQL Select query against passed in search\\\n"
"results. All fields referenced in the select statement must be\\\n"
"prefixed with an underscore. Therefore, \"ip\" should be references as\\\n"
"\"_ip\" and \"_raw\" should be referenced as \"__raw\". Before the "
"select\\\n"
"command is executed, the previous search results are put into a\\\n"
"temporary database table called \"results\". If a row has no values,\\\n"
"\"select\" ignores it to prevent blank search results."
msgstr ""
"按照\\\n"
"http://www.sqlite.org/lang_select.html 中的语法，sql select 作为参数的值。  如果在 select-arg 中未指定\\\n"
" \"from results\"，会自动将其插入。\\\n"
"按照搜索结果中传递的查询运行 SQL Select 查询。\\\n"
" 在 select 语句中引用的所有字段都必须以下划线作为前缀。\\\n"
" 因此，\"ip\" 应引用为\\\n"
"\"_ip\"，\"_raw\" 应引用为 \"__raw\"。 在执行 select \\\n"
"命令前，先前的搜索结果放到称为\\\n"
" \"results\" 的临时数据库表中。 如果行没有值，\\\n"
"\"select\" 会将其忽略，以防止出现空白搜索结果。"

