#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:483 
msgid "Append subtotals for each action across all users"
msgstr "跨所有用户附加每个操作的小计值"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2309 
msgid ""
"Append the \"usertogroup\" lookup table, as specified in transforms.conf "
"file, and add to the current search results."
msgstr "添加 transforms.conf 文件中指定的 \"usertogroup\" 查找表，并将其添加到当前搜索结果中。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:446 
#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6628 
msgid "Append the current results with the tabular results of errors."
msgstr "将错误结果表格附加到当前结果。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:445 
msgid ""
"Append the results of a subsearch as additional results at the end of the"
" current results."
msgstr "将子搜索的结果作为额外的结果附加到当前结果的末尾。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1469 
msgid ""
"Append the value \"bar\" and the values of field baz to the values of "
"field foo and return as multi-valued.  foo and baz could either be multi "
"or single valued field."
msgstr "将值 \"bar\" 和字段 baz 的值追加到字段 foo 的值中，并以多值形式返回。foo 和 baz 既可以是多值字段，也可以是单值字段。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1533 
msgid ""
"Append the value \"bar\" to the array stored in the \"foo\" key in the "
"JSON object titled \"my_array\"."
msgstr "将值 \"bar\" 附加到标题为 \"my_array\" 的 JSON 对象 \"foo\" 密钥中储存的数组。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:205 
msgid "Appends a new result to the end of the search result set."
msgstr "向搜索结果集末尾附加新结果。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:210 
msgid ""
"Appends a new result to the end of the search result set.\\\n"
"The result contains the sum of each numeric field or you can specify "
"which fields\\\n"
"to summarize. Results are displayed on the Statistics tab. If the "
"labelfield argument\\\n"
"is specified, a column is added to the statistical results table with the"
" name\\\n"
"specified."
msgstr ""
"向搜索结果集末尾附加新结果。\\\n"
"结果包含每个数字字段的总和，或者可以指定汇总\\\n"
"哪些字段。结果显示于统计选项卡中。如果 labelfield 参数\\\n"
"已指定，统计结果表中将新增一列，\\\n"
"并且列名称已指定。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:469 
msgid ""
"Appends fields of the results of the subsearch into input search results "
"by combining the external fields of the subsearch (fields that do not "
"start with '_') into the current results.  The first subsearch result is "
"merged with the first main result, the second with the second, and so on."
"  If option override is false (default), if a field is present in both a "
"subsearch result and the main result, the main result is used.  If it is "
"true, the subsearch result's value for that field is used."
msgstr "通过将子搜索的外部字段(不以 '_' 开头的字段)组合到当前结果，将子搜索结果的字段附加到输入搜索结果中。第一个子搜索结果与第一个主结果合并，第二个与第二个合并，依此类推。如果 override 选项为 false(默认值)，并且某个字段同时存在于子搜索结果和主结果中，则使用主结果。如果为 true，则使用该字段的子搜索结果的值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:468 
msgid ""
"Appends the fields of the subsearch results to current results, first "
"results to first result, second to second, etc."
msgstr "将子搜索结果的字段附加到当前结果，第一组子搜索结果对应第一个结果，第二组对应第二个，依此类推。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:482 
msgid ""
"Appends the result of the subpipeline applied to the current result set "
"to results."
msgstr "将应用于当前结果集的子管道的结果附加到结果。"

