#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4782 
msgid ""
"Calculate aggregate statistics over the dataset, optionally grouped by a "
"list of fields.\\\n"
"Aggregate statistics include: \\i\\\\\n"
"* count, distinct count \\i\\\\\n"
"* mean, median, mode \\i\\\\\n"
"* min, max, range, percentiles \\i\\\\\n"
"* standard deviation, variance \\i\\\\\n"
"* sum \\i\\\\\n"
"* earliest and latest occurrence \\i\\\\\n"
"* first and last (according to input order into stats command) occurrence"
" \\p\\\\\n"
"Similar to SQL aggregation. \\\n"
"If called without a by-clause, one row is produced, which represents the "
"\\\n"
"aggregation over the entire incoming result set. If called with a \\\n"
"by-clause, one row is produced for each distinct value of the by-clause. "
"\\\n"
"The 'partitions' option, if specified, allows stats to partition the \\\n"
"input data based on the split-by fields for multithreaded reduce. \\\n"
"The 'allnum' option, if true (default = false), computes numerical "
"statistics on each \\\n"
"field if and only if all of the values of that field are numerical. \\\n"
"The 'delim' option is used to specify how the values in the 'list' or "
"'values' aggregation are delimited.  (default is a single space)\\\n"
"When called with the name \"prestats\", it will produce intermediate "
"results (internal)."
msgstr ""
"计算数据集的聚合统计信息，可以选择按字段列表分组。\\\n"
"聚合统计信息包括: \\i\\\\\n"
"* 计数、非重复计数 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 平均值、中值、模式 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 最小值、最大值、范围、百分比 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 标准偏差、方差 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 求和 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 最早和最晚出现 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 第一次和最后一次(根据 stats 命令的输入顺序)出现 \\p\\\\\n"
"与 SQL 聚合类似。 \\\n"
"如果未使用 by 子句进行调用，将生成一行，表示\\\n"
"整个传入结果集的聚合。 如果使用 \\\n"
"by 子句进行调用，将为 by 子句的每个非重复值生成一行。 \\\n"
"如果指定 'partitions' 选项，则允许 stats 根据\\\n"
"拆分依据字段对输入数据进行分区以实现多线程减少。 \\\n"
"如果 'allnum' 选项为 true(默认值 = false)，则计算每个字段的数字统计信息\\\n"
"(当且仅当该字段的全部值均为数字时)。\\\n"
"'delim' 选项用于指定 'list' 或 'values' 聚合中各个值的分隔方式。(默认值为一个空格)\\\n"
"当使用名称 \"prestats\" 进行调用时，它将生成中间结果(内部)。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5163 
msgid "Calculate the average value of \"CPU\" each minute for each \"host\"."
msgstr "为每个\"主机\"计算每分钟 \"CPU\" 平均值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1022 
msgid "Calculate the co-occurrence correlation between all fields."
msgstr "计算所有字段之间的同现关联。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1021 
msgid "Calculate the correlation between all fields."
msgstr "计算所有字段之间的相关性。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:866 
msgid ""
"Calculate the number of concurrent events for each event start time and "
"emit as field 'foo'"
msgstr "计算每个事件开始时间的并发事件数量，并以字段 'foo' 形式发出"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:869 
msgid ""
"Calculate the number of concurrent events using the 'et' field as the "
"start time \\\n"
"and 'length' as the duration."
msgstr ""
"使用 'et' 字段作为开始时间，'length' 字段作为持续时间，\\\n"
"计算并发事件的数量。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:871 
msgid ""
"Calculate the number of ongoing http requests at the start time of each "
"http request in a splunk access log"
msgstr "计算在 splunk 访问日志中每个 http 请求的开始时间正在进行的 http 请求的数量"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1799 
msgid ""
"Calculate the sum of the values in the multivalue field 'mv'. Place the "
"sum in the 'total' field."
msgstr "计算多值字段 'mv' 中数值的总和。将总和放入 'total' 字段。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:261 
msgid ""
"Calculate the sums of the numeric fields of each result, and put the sums"
" in the field \"sum\"."
msgstr "计算每个结果的数值型字段的总和，并将总和保存在总和揬字段中。"

