#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1018 
msgid ""
"Calculates a co-occurrence matrix, which contains the percentage of times"
" that two \\\n"
"fields exist in the same events.  The RowField field contains the name of"
" the field considered \\\n"
"for the row, while the other column names (fields) are the fields it is "
"being compared against. \\\n"
"Values are the ratio of occurrences when both fields appeared to "
"occurrences when only one field appeared."
msgstr ""
"计算同现矩阵，其中包含两个\\\n"
"字段存在于相同事件中的时间的百分比。RowField 字段包含\\\n"
"用于该行的字段名称，而其他列的名称(字段)是与其进行比较的字段。\\\n"
"其值为两个字段都出现并发时与只有一个字段出现时并发的比例。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1313 
msgid ""
"Calculates an expression and puts the resulting value into a field. You "
"can specify to calculate more than one expression."
msgstr "计算一个表达式，并将结果值代入字段。您可以指定计算多个表达式。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5970 
msgid ""
"Calculates the 'eventtype' field for search results that match a \\\n"
"known event type."
msgstr ""
"计算与已知事件类型匹配的搜索结果的\\\n"
"'eventtype' 字段。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1014 
msgid "Calculates the correlation between different fields."
msgstr "计算不同字段之间的相关性。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5968 
msgid "Calculates the event types for the search results."
msgstr "计算搜索结果的事件类型。"

