#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3674 
msgid ""
"Calls an external python program that can modify or generate search "
"results.  \\\n"
"Scripts must be declared in commands.conf and be located in "
"\"$SPLUNK_HOME/etc/apps/app_name/bin\". \\\n"
"The  scripts are run with \"$SPLUNK_HOME/bin/python\"."
msgstr ""
"调用可以修改或生成搜索结果的外部 python 程序。\\\n"
"脚本必须在 commands.conf 中声明并且位于 \"$SPLUNK_HOME/etc/apps/app_name/bin\" 中。\\\n"
"脚本使用 \"$SPLUNK_HOME/bin/python\" 运行。"

