"                            捕获进行更改的进程名称，以及已更改\n"
"                            条目的路径名称。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinPrintmon.js:3 
msgid ""
"Configure this instance to capture Windows information about printers, "
"drivers, print jobs, and \n"
"                        printer ports on this Windows machine. This "
"monitor runs once for every input defined on the machine, at \n"
"                        the interval specified in the input. "
msgstr ""
"配置此实例以在此 Windows 计算机上捕获有关打印机、驱动程序，打印任务和\n"
"                        打印端口的 Windows 信息。此监视器为每个在计算机上定义的输入运行一次，按\n"
"                        输入中指定的间隔运行。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinHostmon.js:3 
msgid ""
"Configure this instance to capture detailed information about this "
"machine, such as software \n"
"                        installation, service control, and uptime. The "
"host monitor input runs once for every input defined, \n"
"                        at the interval specified in the input. "
msgstr ""
"配置此实例以捕获有关此计算机的详细信息，如软件\n"
"                        安装、服务控制和运行时间。主机监视输入为每个定义的输入运行一次，\n"
"                        按输入中指定的间隔运行。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinNetmon.js:3 
msgid ""
"Configure this instance to capture statistics about network activity into"
" or out of this machine. \n"
"                        The network monitor input runs once for every "
"input defined, at the interval specified in the input."
msgstr ""
"配置此实例以捕获有关此计算机进出的网络活动的统计信息。 \n"
"                        网络监视输入按输入中指定的间隔为每个定义的输入运行一次。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinPerfmonRemote.js:3 
msgid ""
"Configure this instance to collect performance metrics on remote Windows "
"machines using the \n"
"                         Windows Management Instrumentation (WMI) "
"framework. The Splunk platform must run as an Active Directory \n"
"                         user with appropriate access to the remote "
"machine. Both the Splunk platform and the remote machine must \n"
"                         reside in the same AD domain or forest. "
msgstr ""
"使用 \n"
"                         Windows Management Instrumentation (WMI) 框架，配置此实例以收集远程 Windows 计算机的性能指标。Splunk 平台必须以 Active Directory \n"
"                         用户(具有远程计算机适当的访问权限)身份运行。Splunk 平台和远程计算机都必须\n"
"                         驻留在相同的 AD 域或林。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/Script.js:3 
msgid ""
"Configure this instance to execute a script or command and to capture its"
" output as event \n"
"                    data. Scripted inputs are useful when the data that "
"you want to index is not available in a file to monitor. "
msgstr ""
