#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5777 
msgid ""
"DEPRECATED: The preferred usage of transaction is for list of fields to "
"be specified directly as arguments.  E.g. 'transaction foo bar' rather "
"than 'transaction fields=\"foo,bar\"' \\\n"
"The 'fields' constraint takes a list of fields.  For search results to be"
" members of a transaction, for each \\\n"
"field specified, if they have a value, it must have the same value as "
"other members in that transaction. \\\n"
"For example, a search result that has host=mylaptop can never be in the "
"same transaction as a search result \\\n"
"that has host=myserver, if host is one of the constraints.  A search "
"result that does not have a host value, \\\n"
"however, can be in a transaction with another search result that has "
"host=mylaptop, because they are not inconsistent."
msgstr ""
"已弃用: 交易的首选用法是直接指定为参数的字段列表。如 'transaction foo bar' 而不是 'transaction fields=\"foo,bar\"' \\\n"
"字段揬约束接受字段列表。  要使搜索结果成为某一交易的成员，对于指定的\\\n"
"每个字段，如果搜索结果具有一个值，则它必须与该交易中其他成员的值相同。 \\\n"
"例如，具有 host=mylaptop 的搜索结果永远不会与\\\n"
"具有 host=myserver 的搜索结果处在相同的交易中(如果主机是一个约束)。  但是，没有主机值的搜索结果\\\n"
"可以与另一个具有 host=mylaptop 的搜索结果处在一个交易中，因为它们不相抵触。"

