#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3293 
msgid ""
"Find events in a summary index that overlap in time, or\\\n"
"find gaps in time during which a scheduled saved search may have\\\n"
"missed events.  Note: If you find a gap, run the search over the period\\"
"\n"
"of the gap and summary index the results (using | collect). If you\\\n"
"find overlapping events, manually delete the overlaps from the summary\\\n"
"index by using the search language.  Invokes an external python script\\\n"
"(in etc/apps/search/bin/sumindexoverlap.py), which expects input events\\"
"\n"
"from the summary index and finds any time overlaps and gaps between\\\n"
"events with the same 'info_search_name' but different\\\n"
"'info_search_id'.  Input events are expected to have the following\\\n"
"fields: 'info_min_time', 'info_max_time' (inclusive and exclusive,\\\n"
"respectively) , 'info_search_id' and 'info_search_name' fields."
msgstr ""
"在时间重叠的摘要索引中查找事件，或者\\\n"
"查找时间间隙，在该间隙内，计划的已保存搜索可能有\\\n"
"缺失的事件。注意: 如果找到间隙，则在间隙期间内运行搜索，并为结果\\\n"
"新建摘要索引(使用 | collect)。如果\\\n"
"查找重叠事件，则使用搜索语言从摘要索引\\\n"
"中手动删除重叠事件。调用外部 python 脚本\\\n"
"(在 etc/apps/search/bin/sumindexoverlap.py 中)，其需要来自摘要索引的输入事件，\\\n"
"并在 'info_search_name' 相同而 'info_search_id' 不同的\\\n"
"事件之间查找任何时间\\\n"
"重叠和间隙。输入事件应具有以下\\\n"
"字段: 'info_min_time' (含)、'info_max_time' (不含)、\\\n"
"'info_search_id' 和 'info_search_name' 字段。"

