#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1228 
msgid ""
"For each event where 'count' exists, compute the difference between count"
" and its previous value and store the result in 'countdiff'."
msgstr "对于存在 'count' 的每个事件，计算计数值与其上一个值之间的差，并在 'countdiff' 中存储结果。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1225 
msgid ""
"For each event where <field> is a number, compute the difference, in "
"search order, between the current event's value of <field> and a previous"
" event's value of <field> and write this difference into "
"<field:newfield>.  If <newfield> if not specified, it defaults to "
"\"delta(<field>)\"   If p is unspecified, the default = 1, meaning the "
"the immediate previous value is used.  p=2 would mean that the value "
"before the previous value is used, etc etc etc."
msgstr "对于 <field> 是数值的每个事件，按搜索顺序计算当前事件 <field> 值与先前事件 <field> 值之间的差异，并将该差异写入 <field:newfield>。如果不指定 <newfield>，默认为 \"delta(<field>)\"   如果不指定 p，则默认值 = 1，意味着使用前面紧邻的值。p=2 意味着使用先前值的前一个值，依此类推。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:191 
msgid ""
"For each event where <field> is a number, keep a running total of the sum"
" of this number and write it out to either the same field, or a new field"
" if specified."
msgstr "对于 <field> 是数值的每个事件，保留此数值之和的累计值并将其写入同一个字段，或一个新字段(如果指定)。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4727 
msgid ""
"For each event, add a count field that represent the number of events "
"seen so far (including that event).  For example, 1 for the first event, "
"2 for the second, and so on."
msgstr "对于每个事件，添加一个计数字段来表示目前已发现的事件数量(包括该事件)。例如，1 表示第一个事件，2 表示第二个事件，依此类推。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4729 
msgid ""
"For each event, compute the average of field foo over the last 5 events "
"(including the current event).  Similar to doing trendline sma5(foo)"
msgstr "对于每个事件，计算最后 5 个事件(包括当前事件)的字段 foo 平均值。  类似于执行 trendline sma5(foo)"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:599 
msgid ""
"For each event, copy the 2nd, 3rd, 4th, and 5th previous values of the "
"'count' field into the respective fields 'count_p2', 'count_p3', "
"'count_p4', and 'count_p5'."
msgstr "对于每个事件，将前面第 2、3、4 和 5 个 'count' 字段值复制到相应字段 'count_p2'、'count_p3'、'count_p4' 和 'count_p5' 中。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:601 
msgid ""
"For each event, copy the 3rd previous value of the 'foo' field into the "
"field 'oldfoo'."
msgstr "对于每个事件，将 'foo' 字段的前面第 3 个值复制到字段 'oldfoo' 中。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1803 
msgid ""
"For each field that matches 'myField*', add it to the corresponding "
"'someField*' field and write to a 'new_*' field (e.g. new_X = myFieldX + "
"someFieldX)"
msgstr "对于与 'myField*' 匹配的每个字段，将它添加到对应的 'someField*' 字段，并写入到 'new_*' 字段(如 new_X = myFieldX + someFieldX)"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1797 
msgid ""
"For each field that starts with \"test\", calculate the sum of the field "
"values."
msgstr "对于以 \"test\" 开头的每个字段，计算字段值的总和。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2993 
msgid ""
"For each group of results that are identical except for the given field, "
"combine them into a single result where the given field is a multivalue "
"field.  DELIM controls how values are combined, defaulting to a space "
"character (' ')."
msgstr "对于除给定字段外完全相同的每组结果，将这些结果合并到单个结果中，其中给定字段是多值字段。DELIM 控制是否合并值，默认值为空格字符 (' ')。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2885 
msgid ""
"For each input search result, takes the field-values\\\n"
"from that result and substitutes their value for the $variable$ in the\\\n"
"search argument.  The value of variables surrounded in quotes (e.g. "
"text=\"$_raw$\") will be quote escaped. \\\n"
"The search argument can either be a search string to run\\\n"
"or the name of a savedsearch. The following metavariables are \\\n"
"also supported: \\\n"
"1. $_serial_id$ - 1-based serial number within map of the search being "
"executed."
msgstr ""
"对于每个输入搜索结果，从该结果选取字段-值，\\\n"
"并替换搜索参数值 $variable$ \\\n"
"的值。引号引起的变量值(例如，text=\"$_raw$\")将进行引号转义。\\\n"
"搜索参数可以是要运行的搜索字符串\\\n"
"或是已保存搜索的名称。还支持以下\\\n"
"元变量:\\\n"
"1. $_serial_id$ - 所执行的搜索映射中以 1 为基数的序列号。"

