"从默认指标索引中获取主机 \"x\" 且 metric_name 为 \"aws.ec2.CPUUtilization\" \\\n"
"的数据点的各应用程序计数。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5549 
msgid ""
"Get the count of all measurements every hour for the first minute in the "
"\"mymetrics\" index where \\\n"
"the metric name is \"aws.ec2.CPUUtilization\"."
msgstr ""
"在每个小时的第一分钟获取 \"mymetrics\" 索引中指标名称为 \"aws.ec2.CPUUtilization\" 的\\\n"
"所有评估的计数。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5523 
msgid ""
"Get the count of all measurements in the \"mymetrics\" index where \\\n"
"the metric_name value is \"os.mem.rss\"."
msgstr ""
"获取 \"mymetrics\" 索引中 metric_name 值为 \"os.mem.rss\" 的\\\n"
"所有评估的计数。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5541 
msgid ""
"Get the median of all measurements from the default metrics indexes, \\\n"
"where the metric name is \"aws.ec2.CPUUtilization\"."
msgstr ""
"从默认指标索引中获取所有评估的中值，\\\n"
"其中指标名称为 \"aws.ec2.CPUUtilization\"。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1527 
msgid ""
"Get the numerical average (mean) of the values of the 'foo' and 'bar' "
"fields. This is equivalent to 'sum(foo,bar)/(mvcount(foo) + "
"mvcount(bar))'."
msgstr "获取 'foo' 和 'bar' 字段值的数值平均值(均值)。这等效于 'sum(foo,bar)/(mvcount(foo) + mvcount(bar))'。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1841 
msgid ""
"Get the top 2 results. Create a search from the host, source and "
"sourcetype fields. Use the default format values. The result is a single "
"result in a new field called \"search\": \\\n"
"( ( host=\"mylaptop\" AND source=\"syslog.log\" AND sourcetype=\"syslog\""
" ) OR ( host=\"bobslaptop\" AND source=\"bob-syslog.log\" AND "
"sourcetype=\"syslog\" ) )"
msgstr ""
"获取前 2 个结果。从主机、来源和来源类型新建搜索。使用默认格式的值。此结果为名为 \"search\" 的新字段内的单个结果: \\\n"
"[ [ host=\"mylaptop\" && source=\"syslog.log\" && sourcetype=\"syslog\" ] || [ host=\"bobslaptop\" && source=\"bob-syslog.log\" && sourcetype=\"syslog\" ] ]"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1838 
msgid ""
"Get the top 2 results. Create a search from the host, source and "
"sourcetype fields. Use the specified format values. \\\n"
"[ [ host=\"mylaptop\" && source=\"syslog.log\" && sourcetype=\"syslog\" ]"
" || [ host=\"bobslaptop\" && source=\"bob-syslog.log\" && "
"sourcetype=\"syslog\" ] ]"
msgstr ""
"获取前 2 个结果。从主机、来源和来源类型新建搜索。使用指定格式的值。\\\n"
"[ [ host=\"mylaptop\" && source=\"syslog.log\" && sourcetype=\"syslog\" ] || [ host=\"bobslaptop\" && source=\"bob-syslog.log\" && sourcetype=\"syslog\" ] ]"

