#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6774 
msgid ""
"In this example, the eventstats and where commands are processed \\\n"
"in parallel on the reducers, while the sort command and any commands \\\n"
"following it are processed on the search head. This happens because \\\n"
"sort is a nonstreaming command that is not supported by prjob."
msgstr ""
"在本示例中，eventstats 和 where 命令由化简器\\\n"
"进行并行处理，而 sort 命令及其后的所有命令\\\n"
"由搜索头进行处理。这是因为，\\\n"
"sort 是一个 prjob 不支持的非流命令。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3523 
