msgid ""
"Matches the value of the field against the unanchored regex and extracts "
"\\\n"
"the perl regex named groups into fields of the corresponding names. If \\"
"\n"
"mode is set to 'sed' the given sed expression will be applied to the "
"value \\\n"
"of the chosen field (or to _raw if a field is not specified). \\\n"
"max_match controls the number of times the regex is matched, if greater "
"than one \\\n"
"the resulting fields will be multivalued fields, defaults to 1, use 0 to "
"mean unlimited."
msgstr ""
"将字段值与未定位的 regex 相匹配，并将\\\n"
"perl regex 命名的组提取到名称对应的字段中。 如果\\\n"
"模式设置为 'sed'，将对所选字段(如果未指定字段，则为 _raw 字段)的值应用给定的 sed 表达式。\\\n"
" \\\n"
"max_match 控制匹配 regex 的次数，如果大于 1，\\\n"
"生成的字段将为多值字段，默认为 1，使用 0 意味着无限制。"

