#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1087 
msgid ""
"Must be the first command in a search. When used with no \\\n"
"arguments, returns the JSON for all data models available in the \\\n"
"current context. When used with just a modelName, returns the \\\n"
"JSON for a single data model. When used with a modelName and \\\n"
"objectName, returns the JSON for a single data model dataset. \\\n"
"When used with modelName, objectName and 'dm-search-mode', runs  \\\n"
"the search for the specified search mode.\\\n"
"\"allow_old_summaries\": Only applies when you use 'datamodel' to \\\n"
"search an accelerated data model. Defaults to false. \\\n"
"When allow_old_summaries=false, the Splunk software only \\\n"
"provides results from TSIDX data model summary directories that \\\n"
"are up-to-date. In other words, if the data model definition has \\\n"
"changed, the Splunk software does not use data model summary \\\n"
"directories that are older than the current definition when it \\\n"
"returns 'datamodel' command output. This default ensures that \\\n"
"the output from the datamodel search command always reflects \\\n"
"your current configuration. When allow_old_summaries=true, the \\\n"
"'datamodel' command uses both current summary data and \\\n"
"summary data that was generated prior to a change to the data \\\n"
"model definition. This is an advanced performance feature for \\\n"
"cases where the old summaries are \"good enough\".\\\n"
"\"summariesonly\": Only applies when you use 'datamodel' to \\\n"
"search an accelerated data model. Defaults to false. When \\\n"
"summariesonly = false, the search generates results both \\\n"
"summarized and unsummarized data. For unsummarized data, the \\\n"
"search runs against the original indexed data. When \\\n"
"summariesonly = true, the search runs only against data model \\\n"
"summaries. It does not generate results from unsummarized data.\\\n"
"\"strict_fields\": Only applies when you use 'datamodel' to search\\\n"
"a data model. Defaults to true. When 'strict_fields = false', \\\n"
"the command returns all fields, rather than just the set of \\\n"
"fields that are defined within the constraints for the data \\\n"
"model. This includes fields inherited from parent data models \\\n"
"and fields that are derived through search-time processes such \\\n"
"as field extraction, lookup matching, and field calculation."
msgstr ""
"必须是搜索中的第一个命令。在不使用\\\n"
"参数时，为当前上下文中可用的所有数据模型\\\n"
"返回 JSON。在仅使用 modelName 时，为单个数据模型\\\n"
"返回 JSON。在与 modelName 和\\\n"
"objectName 搭配使用时，为单个数据模型数据集返回 JSON。\\\n"
"在与 modelName、objectName 和 'dm-search-mode' 搭配使用时，为\\\n"
"指定的搜索模式运行搜索。\\\n"
"\"allow_old_summaries\": 仅在使用 'datamodel' 搜索\\\n"
"加速的数据模型时适用。默认值为 false。\\\n"
"当 allow_old_summaries=false 时，Splunk 软件仅\\\n"
"提供来自最新的 TSIDX 数据模型摘要目录的\\\n"
"结果。换句话说，如果数据模型定义已更改，\\\n"
"Splunk 软件在返回 \"datamodel\" 命令输出时，\\\n"
"不会使用比当前定义更旧的数据模型\\\n"
"摘要目录。此默认设置可确保\\\n"
"数据模型搜索命令的输出始终反映\\\n"
"您当前的配置。当 allow_old_summaries=true 时，\\\n"
"\"datamodel\" 命令将使用当前摘要数据和\\\n"
"数据模型定义更改前生成的\\\n"
"摘要数据。这是一种高级性能功能，\\\n"
"适用于旧摘要已“足够好”的情况。\\\n"
"\"summariesonly\": 仅在使用 'datamodel’\\\n"
"搜索加速数据模型时适用。默认为 false。当\\\n"
"summariesonly = false，搜索为汇总和未汇总数据\\\n"
"生成结果，对于未汇总数据，\\\n"
"搜索作用于原始建立了索引的数据。当\\\n"
"summariesonly = true 时，搜索仅作用于数据模型\\\n"
"摘要。不会通过未汇总数据生成结果。\n"
"\"strict_fields\": 仅当您使用 'datamodel' 搜索\\\n"
"数据模型时适用。默认为 true。当 'strict_fields = false' 时，\\\n"
"命令会返回所有字段，而不仅仅是\\\n"
"数据模型限制中定义的字段集。\\\n"
"这包括从父数据模型集成的字段\\\n"
"以及通过搜索时间进程(如字段提取、查找匹配\\\n"
"和字段计算)衍生的字段。"

