#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6095 
msgid ""
"Reads a REST API endpoint and displays the returned entities as search "
"results."
msgstr "读取 REST API 端点，并显示返回的实体作为搜索结果。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2305 
msgid ""
"Reads in a lookup table as specified by a filename (must end with .csv or"
" .csv.gz) \\\n"
"or a table name (as specified by a stanza name in transforms.conf)."
"                \\\n"
"If 'append' is set to true, the search processor appends the"
"                       \\\n"
"data from the lookup file to the current set of results instead"
"                    \\\n"
"of replacing it. Defaults to false."
"                                                \\\n"
"If 'strict' is set to true, the search fails completely if the"
"                     \\\n"
"command raises an error (such as the provision of a nonexistent"
"                    \\\n"
"filename). Defaults to false."
msgstr ""
"读取由文件名(必须以 .csv 或 .csv.gz 结尾)指定的查找表\\\n"
"或表名(由 transforms.conf 中的段落名指定)。\\\n"
"如果将 'append' 设置为 true，则搜索处理器\\\n"
"会将查找文件中的数据附加到当前结果集中，\\\n"
"而不是替换结果。默认值为 false。\\\n"
"如果 'strict' 设置为 true，则在命令引发\\\n"
"错误时(例如，提供不存在的文档名称)，则搜索会\\\n"
"彻底失败。默认值为 false。"

