#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6415 
msgid ""
"Useful for passing values up from a subsearch. Replaces the incoming "
"events with one event, with one attribute: \"search\". Automatically "
"limits the incoming results with \"head\" and \"fields\", to improve "
"performance. Allows convenient outputting of attr=value (e.g., \"return "
"source\"), alias_attr=value (e.g. \"return ip=srcip\"), and value (e.g., "
"\"return $srcip\"). Defaults to using just the first row of results "
"handed to it. Multiple rows can be specified with COUNT (e.g. \"return 2 "
"ip\"), and each row is ORd (e.g., output might be \"(ip=10.1.11.2) OR "
"(ip=10.2.12.3)\"). Multiple values can be specified and are placed within"
" OR clauses. So \"return 2 user ip\" might output \"(user=bob "
"ip=10.1.11.2) OR (user=fred ip=10.2.12.3)\". Using \"return\" at the end "
"of a subsearch removes the need, in the vast majority of cases, for "
"\"head\", \"fields\", \"rename\", \"format\", and \"dedup\". If you "
"encounter problems with 'return', try 'oldreturn'."
msgstr ""
"从子搜索中向上传递值时很有用。使用一个事件替换传入事件，具有一个属性: \"search\"。自动使用 \"head\" 和 \"fields\" 限制传入结果，以提高性能。可以方便地输出 attr=value (例如，\"return source\")、alias_attr=value (例如，\"return ip=srcip\") 和值(例如，\"return $srcip\")。默认为只使用传递给它的第一行结果。可以使用 COUNT (例如，\"return 2 ip\")指定多行，并且每行都用 OR 连接(例如，输出可能是 \"(ip=10.1.11.2) OR (ip=10.2.12.3)\")。可以指定多个值，并将其置于 OR 子句中。因此，\"return 2 user ip\" 可能输出 \"(user=bob ip=10.1.11.2) OR (user=fred "
"ip=10.2.12.3)\"。在子搜索的结尾处使用 \"return\" 会在大多数情况下不再需要 \"head\"、\"fields\"、\"rename\"、\"format\" 和 \"dedup\"。如果您使用 \"return\" 时遇到问题，请尝试 \"oldreturn\"。"

