"distinguished from non-evicted transactions by checking the value of the "
"'closed_txn' field, which is set to '0' for evicted transactions and '1' "
"for closed ones. A transaction is evicted from memory when the memory "
"limitations are reached."
msgstr "是否输出已退出的交易。 可以通过检查 'closed_txn' 字段的值(设置为 '0' 时代表已退出的交易，'1' 代表已关闭的交易)来区分已退出的交易与未退出的交易。 交易会在达到内存限制时从内存中退出。"

