#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5375 
msgid "Writes the result table into *.tsidx files using indexed fields format."
msgstr "使用索引的字段格式将结果表写入 *.tsidx 文件。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5387 
msgid ""
"Writes the result table into *.tsidx files, for later use by tstats "
"command. \\\n"
"Only non-internal fields and values are written to the tsidx files. \\\n"
"squashcase is false by default; if true, the field *values* are converted"
" \\\n"
"to lowercase when writing them to the *.tsidx files. If namespace is "
"provided, \\\n"
"the tsidx files are written to a directory of that name under the main "
"tsidx  \\\n"
"stats directory. These namespaces can be written to multiple times to add"
" new \\\n"
"data. If namespace is not provided, the files are written to a directory "
"within \\\n"
"the job directory of that search, and will live as long as the job does. "
"\\\n"
"If keepresults is set to true, tscollect will output the same results it "
"received \\\n"
"as input. By default this is false, and only emits a count of results "
"processed (this \\\n"
"is more efficient as we do not need to store as many results). \\\n"
"The 'indexes_edit' capability is required to run this command."
msgstr ""
"将结果表写入 *.tsidx 文件，供 tstats 命令今后使用。 \\\n"
"只有非内部字段和值可写入 tsidx 文件。 \\\n"
"squashcase 在默认情况下为 false；如果为 true，则字段 *values* \\\n"
"在将它们写入 *.tsidx 文件时转换为小写。 如提供命名空间，\\\n"
"tsidx 文件写入该名称在主 tsidx \\\n"
"统计目录下的该名称的目录。 这些命名空间无法写入多次以添加新\\\n"
"数据。 如没有提供命名空间，文件将写入该搜索的\\\n"
"工作目录中的目录，并将和任务的时间一样长。 \\\n"
"如 keepresults 设置为 true，tscollect 将输出它作为输入收到的相同\\\n"
"结果。 这在默认情况下为 false，并且只发出已处理结果的计数(这\\\n"
"样的效率更高，因为我们无需存储许多结果)。 \\\n"
"需要 'indexes_edit' 功能以运行此命令。"

